---
import {
  KR_PATCH_TOOLKIT_URL,
  KR_PATCH_TOOLKIT_VERSION,
  analysisUrl,
  sourceUrl,
  type KrPatch,
} from '../../lib/kr-patches';

interface Props {
  patch: KrPatch;
  /** The game's folder in the patch source repository. */
  source: string;
  /** What that folder holds. */
  holds: string;
  /** What it leaves out, and where those come from instead. */
  missing: string;
  /** Shared commands taken from kr-patch-toolkit. */
  toolkit: string;
}

const { patch, source, holds, missing, toolkit } = Astro.props;
---

<aside class="making-sources" aria-labelledby="making-sources-title">
  <p id="making-sources-title" class="making-sources-title">
    패치 소스
  </p>
  <dl>
    <div>
      <dt>담긴 것</dt>
      <dd>
        {holds} — <a href={source}>패치 소스(GitHub)</a>
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>공통 도구</dt>
      <dd>
        {toolkit} — <a href={KR_PATCH_TOOLKIT_URL}>kr-patch-toolkit</a> {KR_PATCH_TOOLKIT_VERSION}의{' '}
        <code>krpatch</code> 명령
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>없는 것</dt>
      <dd>{missing}</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>문서</dt>
      <dd>
        롬 주소와 형식은 <a href={analysisUrl(patch)}>롬 분석 문서(docs/ANALYSIS.md)</a>, 빌드 순서는 패치 소스의{' '}
        <a href={sourceUrl(patch)}>안내(README.ko.md)</a>
      </dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>찾는 법</dt>
      <dd>
        각 절 끝 「패치 소스 속 파일」에 그 절에서 쓴 파일을 적었고, 전체 목록은{' '}
        <a href="#making-tools">패치 소스 파일</a>에 있습니다.
      </dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
</aside>
